{
  "id": "wave-halftone",
  "url": "shaders/wave-halftone.wgsl",
  "description": "Hex halftone whose dots stretch along the wave and pick up a 15-degree rosette. Midtones gain dot size, and the screen packs tighter where the wave is strong. Wave speed is normalized to the saved default.",
